# Compact reference files

Use compact files first to save context.

- `.mdc` rules are compact model-facing rules.
- `SKILL.md` and other `.md` skill/reference files are compact model-facing files.
- `.mdh` files are human-readable source/counterpart files.

When both compact and human files exist, read `.mdc` or `.md` during normal agent work. Open `.mdh` only when explicitly editing human prose or when compact content is insufficient.
